逻辑学》（PHIL10003）（3学分），下学期修《数理逻辑》（PHIL20013）（2学分）。数学基础较好的同学也可在大一上学期选《数理逻辑（H）》（4学分荣誉课），选修该课可免修上述两门普通课。两条路线任选其一。原表见 /courseModules/6/commentText。","建议先学　《西方哲学史（上）》（PHIL10001） → 《西方哲学史（下）》（PHIL20002）。题名列出连续册次或级别。按分册顺序建立时间线，读到后来的观点或事件时可回看它回应了什么问题。方案分别列在第2、3学期。","可以对照着读　《哲学导论》（PHIL10002）与《逻辑学》（PHIL10003）。论证与概念分析是哲学讨论的共同方法。","查模块选课　《先秦哲学》（PHIL20014）、《汉晋隋唐哲学》（PHIL20015）列在“必修课程”中。模块说明写明“哲学部分必修课程(44学分) 可根据实际情况弹性选择修读学期”。原表见 /courseModules/9。"],"sourceUrl":"https://fdjwgl.fudan.edu.cn/manager/bizType/2/major-program-search/info/96906?skipAuth=1","wordUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E5%85%A8%E6%A0%A1%E5%9F%B9%E5%85%BB%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%882023-2025/%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E9%99%A2%E7%B3%BB%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE/%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/2025/originals/plan-96906.docx","originalUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E5%85%A8%E6%A0%A1%E5%9F%B9%E5%85%BB%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%882023-2025/%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E9%99%A2%E7%B3%BB%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE/%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/2025/originals/plan-96906.docx","graphUrl":"https://github.com/pythonbug225/fudan-course-atlas/blob/research/schoolwide-cohorts-2023-2025/research/contributions/%E5%85%A8%E6%A0%A1%E5%9F%B9%E5%85%BB%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%882023-2025/%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E9%99%A2%E7%B3%BB%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE/%E5%93%B2%E5%AD%A6%E5%AD%A6%E9%99%A2/2025/plans/96906.md","syllabusReferences":[]}